{"2946140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Windpunk", "steam_appid": 2946140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>📢Announcements &amp; Updates</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/951badc4188435ddf6aeefe9ffce9061.avif?t=1787645143\" width=1920 height=622 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Wasteland Waste Disposal</i> is now <strong>Windpunk</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new name for the same hopeful windswept world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're changing the name to better reflect what the game has become: a wholesome survival crafter about healing a wind swept world with renewables, gliders, and a touch of hope. It also helps us avoid trademark issues with the <i>Wasteland</i> series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You still pilot your Mech-Ark, recycle ruins, ride the wind, and build a better future with your crew. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Kluk 🌱</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/6370ccff25ae6e770cfec22051d6ba4c.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/6370ccff25ae6e770cfec22051d6ba4c.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/6370ccff25ae6e770cfec22051d6ba4c.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/ac935a4eec288cb6577ccd8c9d07115e.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=620 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/ac935a4eec288cb6577ccd8c9d07115e.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/ac935a4eec288cb6577ccd8c9d07115e.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REVERSE THE APOCALYPSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/03f733414e1eb5ffd8252ac3ce414f4d.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/03f733414e1eb5ffd8252ac3ce414f4d.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/03f733414e1eb5ffd8252ac3ce414f4d.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Windpunk</strong> is a glider driven, narrative survival-craft basebuilder adventure where you heal a shattered apocalyptic wasteland reshaped by an massive eco-catastrophe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a breezy glider, command a colossal Mech Ark, shape a better future from the scraps and heal the world still breathing under the wreckage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A MOVING MECH FORTRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/48ffbf3946abf37a968b79c3859fbf2c.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/48ffbf3946abf37a968b79c3859fbf2c.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/48ffbf3946abf37a968b79c3859fbf2c.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking, clanking pre-apocalypse built Ark on legs. your Mech Ark is both home and mobile HQ. Upgrade its systems, mount gadgets, and build your base <i>onto</i> the machine as you travel across harsh biomes. What starts as a rusty junker can become a wind-powered marvel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMALL OPENWORLD</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/b8f74f81b81dfc1e811d586493616811.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/b8f74f81b81dfc1e811d586493616811.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/b8f74f81b81dfc1e811d586493616811.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through canyon winds, scavenge forgotten places, and bounce between massive wind-tunnels to reach new zones. Your customizable glider is a fast and freeing way to explore and escape a storms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD FROM SCRAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/ae035fac2e64bc2fedf5d449fe4b0d0a.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/ae035fac2e64bc2fedf5d449fe4b0d0a.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/ae035fac2e64bc2fedf5d449fe4b0d0a.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn old world junk into high-tech tools. Whether you're lobbing a sawblade as ammo, crafting a solar oven from circuit boards, or decorating your base, everything has a second life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESTORE, BIT BY BIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/4546adf2403a26799de3ba0f312a32d5.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/4546adf2403a26799de3ba0f312a32d5.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/4546adf2403a26799de3ba0f312a32d5.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌳Acid rains and massive storms are a result of poor climate, and will tear holes in your hull if you get too close. Cleanse the land with gadgets, bots, and brainpower. As the dust clears, small oases start to bloom again. Repaired ecosystems unlock new opportunities and expand the world. The wasteland is filled with useful creatures, some friendlier than others. Collect, farm and maintain the wasteland inhabitants to help you cleanse the world. Not all organisms are created equally useful.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/336acdd9890292a4acf1a46ba0d653f7.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=620 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/336acdd9890292a4acf1a46ba0d653f7.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/336acdd9890292a4acf1a46ba0d653f7.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REVERSE THE APOCALYPSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/03f733414e1eb5ffd8252ac3ce414f4d.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/03f733414e1eb5ffd8252ac3ce414f4d.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/03f733414e1eb5ffd8252ac3ce414f4d.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Windpunk</strong> is a glider driven, narrative survival-craft basebuilder adventure where you heal a shattered apocalyptic wasteland reshaped by an massive eco-catastrophe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a breezy glider, command a colossal Mech Ark, shape a better future from the scraps and heal the world still breathing under the wreckage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A MOVING MECH FORTRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/48ffbf3946abf37a968b79c3859fbf2c.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/48ffbf3946abf37a968b79c3859fbf2c.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/48ffbf3946abf37a968b79c3859fbf2c.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking, clanking pre-apocalypse built Ark on legs. your Mech Ark is both home and mobile HQ. Upgrade its systems, mount gadgets, and build your base <i>onto</i> the machine as you travel across harsh biomes. What starts as a rusty junker can become a wind-powered marvel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SMALL OPENWORLD</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/b8f74f81b81dfc1e811d586493616811.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/b8f74f81b81dfc1e811d586493616811.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/b8f74f81b81dfc1e811d586493616811.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through canyon winds, scavenge forgotten places, and bounce between massive wind-tunnels to reach new zones. Your customizable glider is a fast and freeing way to explore and escape a storms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD FROM SCRAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/ae035fac2e64bc2fedf5d449fe4b0d0a.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/ae035fac2e64bc2fedf5d449fe4b0d0a.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/ae035fac2e64bc2fedf5d449fe4b0d0a.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn old world junk into high-tech tools. Whether you're lobbing a sawblade as ammo, crafting a solar oven from circuit boards, or decorating your base, everything has a second life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESTORE, BIT BY BIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/4546adf2403a26799de3ba0f312a32d5.poster.avif?t=1787645143\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/4546adf2403a26799de3ba0f312a32d5.webm?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/4546adf2403a26799de3ba0f312a32d5.mp4?t=1787645143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌳Acid rains and massive storms are a result of poor climate, and will tear holes in your hull if you get too close. Cleanse the land with gadgets, bots, and brainpower. As the dust clears, small oases start to bloom again. Repaired ecosystems unlock new opportunities and expand the world. The wasteland is filled with useful creatures, some friendlier than others. Collect, farm and maintain the wasteland inhabitants to help you cleanse the world. Not all organisms are created equally useful.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946140/extras/336acdd98